{"1":{"w":[{"c":"الْقَارِعَةُ","d":"al-qāriʿatu","e":"The Striking Calamity!"}],"a":{"g":"The Striking Calamity -"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"What"},{"c":"الْقَارِعَةُ","d":"l-qāriʿatu","e":"(is) the Striking Calamity"}],"a":{"g":"What is the Striking Calamity?"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"أَدْرَاكَ","d":"adrāka","e":"will make you know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"الْقَارِعَةُ","d":"l-qāriʿatu","e":"(is) the Striking Calamity"}],"a":{"g":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"يَكُونُ","d":"yakūnu","e":"will be"},{"c":"النَّاسُ","d":"l-nāsu","e":"the mankind"},{"c":"كَالْفَرَاشِ","d":"kal-farāshi","e":"like moths"},{"c":"الْمَبْثُوثِ","d":"l-mabthūthi","e":"scattered"}],"a":{"g":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"وَتَكُونُ","d":"watakūnu","e":"And will be"},{"c":"الْجِبَالُ","d":"l-jibālu","e":"the mountains"},{"c":"كَالْعِهْنِ","d":"kal-ʿih'ni","e":"like wool"},{"c":"الْمَنْفُوشِ","d":"l-manfūshi","e":"fluffed up"}],"a":{"g":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَمَّا","d":"fa-ammā","e":"Then as for"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(him) whose"},{"c":"ثَقُلَتْ","d":"thaqulat","e":"are heavy"},{"c":"مَوَازِينُهُ","d":"mawāzīnuhu","e":"his scales"}],"a":{"g":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"فَهُوَ","d":"fahuwa","e":"Then he"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(will be) in"},{"c":"عِيشَةٍ","d":"ʿīshatin","e":"a life"},{"c":"رَاضِيَةٍ","d":"rāḍiyatin","e":"pleasant"}],"a":{"g":"He will be in a pleasant life."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"But as for"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(him) whose"},{"c":"خَفَّتْ","d":"khaffat","e":"are light"},{"c":"مَوَازِينُهُ","d":"mawāzīnuhu","e":"his scales"}],"a":{"g":"But as for one whose scales are light,"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"فَأُمُّهُ","d":"fa-ummuhu","e":"His abode"},{"c":"هَاوِيَةٌ","d":"hāwiyatun","e":"(will be the) Pit"}],"a":{"g":"His refuge will be an abyss."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"أَدْرَاكَ","d":"adrāka","e":"will make you know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"هِيَهْ","d":"hiyah","e":"it is"}],"a":{"g":"And what can make you know what that is?"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"نَارٌ","d":"nārun","e":"A Fire"},{"c":"حَامِيَةٌ","d":"ḥāmiyatun","e":"intensely hot"}],"a":{"g":"It is a Fire, intensely hot."}}}